# WELCOME TO GO-PRO SPORTS FOOTBALL ACADEMY DUBAI

Join Go-Pro Sports and learn from [Ex-Manchester United Professional Kirk Hilton](https://www.go-prosports.com/our-coaches/), [Go-Pro’s Team of UEFA licensed coaches](https://www.go-prosports.com/our-coaches/) are the best Football Academy in Dubai.
[Boys Football Academy Dubai](https://www.go-prosports.com/boys-academy/)
[Girls Football Academy Dubai](https://www.go-prosports.com/girls-academy/)
“Here at [Go-Pro Sports Football Academy Dubai](https://www.go-prosports.com), we are open to players of all age groups and abilities, we feature both a [boys football academy](https://www.go-prosports.com/boys-academy/) and an autonomous [girls football academy](https://www.go-prosports.com/girls-academy/).
Our aim is to improve you in all aspects of your game, whether you want to get fit, improve your technique, socialise with team-mates or go on to become a professional footballer. We provide a fantastic service which will accommodate your needs.
With our superior standard of [football coaching](https://www.go-prosports.com/coaching/) we expect nothing less than 100 per cent effort, attitude and application all around!
[Go-Pro Sports Football Academy](https://www.go-prosports.com) has been in Dubai for the last 10 years and as director and coach, I know that my team have the experience to not only improve the level of football here in the United Arab Emirates, but also to offer each and every player the chance to understand the game further and to ensure that they are aware of what is absolutely required to become a professional footballer. Check out our [success stories](https://www.go-prosports.com/go-pro-success-stories/) to find out more”
https://www.go-prosports.com/our-coaches/– [Kirk Hilton, Academy Directorand Ex-Manchester United FC](https://www.go-prosports.com/our-coaches/)
